   "title": "Kzoo Makers Team",
   "description": "Meet the Kzoo Makers team - Our volunteer board members and community leaders who guide Kalamazoo's nonprofit makerspace. Learn about our President, Treasurer, Secretary, and board members dedicated to supporting makers and innovation.",
